# Build-time version manifest — regenerated by scripts/generate-version-manifest.cjs
# on every `npm run build`. Never commit; it must reflect the current build's SHA.

# Android build artifacts (keep source, ignore builds)
android/app/build/
android/.gradle/
android/build/
android/local.properties
android/app/release/
*.apk
*.aab
*.keystore
# Exception: commit the shared debug keystore so CI builds use the same
# signature as local builds. This prevents "App not installed as package
# appears to be invalid" errors when updating the APK.
!android/app/debug.keystore
